OL,3,GNEWSADebbie McGee joins walk for brain
OL,4,Atumour charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcGee, who was there with family, said:
OL,7,F"I'm treating it as a happy day. I just
OL,8,Fthink he's looking down on us and he'd
OL,9,Fbe really proud that we're together,
OL,10,Fbut that we're supporting Brain Tumour
OL,11,FResearch."
